_tittenhurst_park_46-200x168.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles&#039; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_46-200x168.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_46-580x487.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_46.jpg 712w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9017\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_46/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_46.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"712,598\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles&amp;#8217; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_46.jpg\" /></a></div></figure></div><p>Looking over the balcony, with <a href=\"/people/linda-mccartney/\">Linda McCartney</a> and <a href=\"/people/yoko-ono/\">Yoko Ono</a>.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_47/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-9018\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMzQzIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgNTAwIDM0MyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"9018\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_47/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_47.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"500,343\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Linda McCartney and Yoko Ono with The Beatles at their final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_47.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_47.jpg\" alt=\"Linda McCartney and Yoko Ono with The Beatles at their final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" width=\"500\" height=\"343\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-9018\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_47.jpg 500w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_47-200x137.jpg 200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" /></a></p><p>The Beatles were photographed standing in another doorway to the assembly hall of Tittenhurst Park. They were then pictured sitting, then standing, in front of two arches adjoining four terraced cottage.</p><div data-carousel-extra='{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/08/22/the-beatles-final-photo-session/&quot;}' id='gallery-3' class='gallery galleryid-3251 gallery-columns-2 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690822_tittenhurst_park_48/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_48-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles&#039; final photography session, Tittenhurst Park, 22 August 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_48-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_48-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690822_tittenhurst_park_48.jpg 486w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"901